<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Consumo por Zonas - Moderno</title>
    {{> styles}}
    {{> modern-styles}}
    <style>
        .header-right {
            text-align: right;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--brand-light);
            padding-left: 24px;
        }

        .total-label-sm {
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
        }

        .total-amount-lg {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--brand-main);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .total-amount-lg .unit {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .metrics-box {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background-color: var(--brand-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .metric-col {
            border-left: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            padding-left: 24px;
        }

        .metric-col:first-child {
            border-left: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .metric-col-right {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .metric-label {
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--brand-accent);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
        }

        .metric-value {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--brand-dark);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .table-container {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        th {
            background-color: var(--brand-main);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        th.text-right { text-align: right; }
        td.text-right { text-align: right; }
        th.text-center { text-align: center; }
        td.text-center { text-align: center; }

        td {
            padding: 9px 12px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }

        tr:nth-child(even) td {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .col-zona { font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-dark); }
        .col-muted { color: var(--text-light); }
        .col-consumo { font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-main); }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 9px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 8.5px;
        }

        .badge-info { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
        .badge-warn { background: #fef3c7; color: #92660b; }
        .badge-zero { color: var(--text-light); }

        .empty-row td {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 24px 12px;
        }

        .footer-container {
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        .footnote {
            font-size: 8px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            max-width: 60%;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .footer-box {
            background-color: var(--brand-main);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            text-align: right;
            min-width: 240px;
        }

        .footer-label {
            font-size: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--brand-light);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .footer-value {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .footer-value .unit {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

    <header class="header">
        <div class="header-left">
            <div class="logo-container">
                <img src="{{institucion.branding.logo.url}}" alt="Logo institucional">
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="title">{{titulo}}</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">{{institucion.nombreLegal}}</p>
                <p class="date-info">
                    Periodo: <span>{{meta.periodoNombre}}</span>
                    · Versión documental: <span>{{institucion.version}}</span>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="header-right">
            <p class="total-label-sm">Consumo total del sistema</p>
            <p class="total-amount-lg">{{kpis.consumoTotalSistema}} <span class="unit">m³</span></p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="metrics-box">
        <div class="metric-col">
            <p class="metric-label">Filtro</p>
            <p class="metric-value">{{filtros.descripcion}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-col">
            <p class="metric-label">Zonas</p>
            <p class="metric-value">{{kpis.totalZonas}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-col">
            <p class="metric-label">Medidores sin lectura</p>
            <p class="metric-value">{{kpis.medidoresSinLectura}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-col metric-col-right">
            <p class="metric-label">Zona de mayor consumo</p>
            <p class="metric-value">{{kpis.zonaMayorConsumo}}</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="table-container">
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 18%;">Zona (Sector)</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%;">Comunidad</th>
                    <th class="text-right" style="width: 13%;">Consumo (m³)</th>
                    <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Medidores</th>
                    <th class="text-right" style="width: 12%;">Promedio (m³)</th>
                    <th class="text-center" style="width: 12%;">Estimadas</th>
                    <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Sin lectura</th>
                    <th class="text-right" style="width: 10%;">% Sistema</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#each data}}
                <tr>
                    <td class="col-zona">{{this.sectorNombre}}</td>
                    <td class="col-muted">{{this.comunidadNombre}}</td>
                    <td class="text-right col-consumo">{{this.consumoTotal}}</td>
                    <td class="text-center">{{this.medidoresConLectura}}</td>
                    <td class="text-right">{{this.consumoPromedio}}</td>
                    <td class="text-center">
                        {{#if this.tieneEstimadas}}
                        <span class="badge badge-info">{{this.estimadasCount}} · {{this.estimadasVolumen}} m³</span>
                        {{else}}
                        <span class="badge-zero">—</span>
                        {{/if}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="text-center">
                        {{#if this.tieneFaltantes}}
                        <span class="badge badge-warn">{{this.medidoresSinLectura}}</span>
                        {{else}}
                        <span class="badge-zero">0</span>
                        {{/if}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="text-right col-muted">{{this.porcentajeSistema}}%</td>
                </tr>
                {{else}}
                <tr class="empty-row">
                    <td colspan="8">No se registró consumo por zona para el periodo seleccionado.</td>
                </tr>
                {{/each}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-container">
        <p class="footnote">
            Consumo medido = lecturas APROBADA y PLANILLADA. Las estimadas se
            reportan por separado y no se suman al consumo medido. "Sin lectura"
            cuenta medidores de contratos activos sin lectura en el periodo (no se
            estima). {{filtros.definicionesVersion}}.
        </p>
        <div class="footer-box">
            <p class="footer-label">Consumo Total del Sistema</p>
            <p class="footer-value">{{kpis.consumoTotalSistema}} <span class="unit">m³</span></p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
